{"abstract":"Understanding broadcast videos is a challenging task in computer vision, as it requires generic reasoning capabilities to appreciate the content offered by the video editing. In this work, we propose SoccerNet-v2, a novel large-scale corpus of manual annotations for the SoccerNet videodataset, along with open challenges to encourage more research in soccer understanding and broadcast production. Specifically, we release around 300k annotations within SoccerNet’s 500 untrimmed broadcast soccer videos. We extend current tasks in the realm of soccer to include action spotting, camera shot segmentation with boundary detection, and we define a novel replay grounding task. For each task, we provide and discuss benchmark results, reproducible with our open-source adapted implementationsof the most relevant works in the field. SoccerNet-v2 is presented to the broader research community to help push computer vision closer to automatic solutions for more generalvideo understanding and production purposes.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Deliege, Adrien","Cioppa, Anthony","Giancola, Silvio","Jamshidi Seikavandi, Meisam","Dueholm, Jacob Velling","Nasrollahi, Kamal","Ghanem, Bernard","Moeslund, Thomas B.","Droogenbroeck, Marc Van"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-101641"],"event":{"end":"2021-06-25","place":"Virtual, Online, us","start":"2021-06-19","title":"2021 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Workshops, CVPRW 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Deliege, Adrien"],"country":["Belgium","Saudi Arabia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","King Abdullah University of Science and Technology","University of Liege"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"soccernet v000000000002 a dataset and benchmarks for holistic understanding of broadcast soccer videos","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/459272070/Deliege_SoccerNet_v2_A_Dataset_and_Benchmarks_for_Holistic_Understanding_of_Broadcast_CVPRW_2021_paper.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-101641","identifier":[{"id":"85116036480","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-b1b654a9-e1e9-4bce-85e3-70e8d0a44b57"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-12273F5D0CB974E06600B65D32719855"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/459272070/Deliege_SoccerNet_v2_A_Dataset_and_Benchmarks_for_Holistic_Understanding_of_Broadcast_CVPRW_2021_paper.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"rem","url":"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2021W/CVSports/html/Deliege_SoccerNet-v2_A_Dataset_and_Benchmarks_for_Holistic_Understanding_of_Broadcast_CVPRW_2021_paper.html","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"be","key":"university of liege","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Liege","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"sa","key":"king abdullah university of science and technology","loc":["Saudi Arabia","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"King Abdullah University of Science and Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","