eckpau","last":"Droogenbroeck","name":"Droogenbroeck, Marc Van","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/cvprw53098.2021.00508","eisbn":["9781665448994"],"isbn":["9781665449007"],"issn":["21607508"],"pages":"4503-4514","publisher":"IEEE (Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers)","series":"IEEE Computer Society Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Workshops","status":"p","title":"2021 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Workshops (CVPRW)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85116036480"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-b1b654a9-e1e9-4bce-85e3-70e8d0a44b57"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"SoccerNet-v2: A Dataset and Benchmarks for Holistic Understanding of Broadcast Soccer Videos","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-101641","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Recent advances have shown sensor-fusion’s vital role in accurate detection, especially for advanced driver assistance systems. We introduce a novel procedure for depth upsampling and sensor-fusion that together lead to an improved detection performance, compared to state-of-the-art results for detecting cars. Upsampling is generally based on combining data from an image to compensate for the low resolution of a LiDAR (Light Detector and Ranging). This paper, on the other hand, presents a framework to obtain dense depth map solely from a single LiDAR point cloud that makes it possible to use just one deep network for both LiDAR and image modalities. The produced full-depth map is added to the grayscale version of the image to produce a two-channel input for a deep neural network. The simple preprocessing structure is efficiently competent in filing cars’ shapes, which helps the fusion framework to outperforms the state-of-the-art on the KITTI object detection for the Car class. Additionally, the combination of depth and image makes it easier for the network to discriminate highly occluded and truncated vehicles.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Jamshidi Seikavandi, Meisam","Nasrollahi, Kamal","Moeslund, Thomas B."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-078111"],"event":{"end":"2020-11-06","place":"Rome, it","start":"2020-11-02","title":"The 13th International Conference on Machine Vision","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East"],"country":["Iran"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","K.N. Toosi University of Technology"],"keyword":["Autonomous driving","Deep learning","Depth Perception","LiDAR","Object detection","Sensor fusion"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"deep car detection by fusing grayscale image and weighted upsampled lidar depth","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/362524938/icmv_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-078111","identifier":[{"id":"85107836656","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-60cb1297-f767-45d9-bba1-9a379ee3b28c"],"keyword":["Autonomous Driving","Deep Learning","Depth Perception","LiDAR","Object Detection","Sensor Fusion"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3AF3BFA6046A0A89BA996890B2C494ED"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/362524938/icmv_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"ir","key":"k n toosi university of technology","loc":["Iran","Asia, Middle East"],"name":"K.N. Toosi University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, AI for the People","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Centre for Mobility and Urban Studies","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Mobility and Tracking Technologies","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Section for Media Technology - Campus Aalborg","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Architecture, Design and Media Technology, Visual Analysis and Perception"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Milestone Systems A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Meisam","key":"jamshidiseikavandipau","last":"Jamshidi Seikavandi","name":"Jamshidi Seikavandi, Meisam","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Kamal","key":"nasrollahipau","last":"Nasrollahi","locid":"cf3e22f1-50e4-481d-9f90-210c8cf38209","name":"Nasrollahi, Kamal","orcid":"0000-0002-1953-0429","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas B.","key":"moeslundpau","last":"Moeslund","locid":"fcec4162-4096-4260-af44-3fc685d0334b","name":"Moeslund, Thomas B.","orcid":"0000-0001-7584-5209","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1117/12.2586908","eisbn":["9781510640405"],"issn":["0277786X"],"publisher":"SPIE - International Society for Optical Engineering","series":"Proceedings of SPIE, the International Society for Optical Engineering","status":"p","title":"International Conference on Machine Vision"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85107836656"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","milestone systems a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-60cb1297-f767-45d9-bba1-9a379ee3b28c"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Deep car detection by fusing grayscale image and weighted upsampled LiDAR depth","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-078111","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
